Template: shaloms-doggy/reboot-now
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Restart the system now to enable I2C?
 I2C was enabled in the Raspberry Pi boot configuration
 (dtparam=i2c_arm=on). A reboot is required before /dev/i2c-1 exists.
 .
 Choose Yes to reboot one minute after this package finishes installing.
 Choose No if you will reboot yourself later.
